re required.\r\n\r\nGet started easily with the universal install script:\r\n\r\n`curl -sSfL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/vaibhav-mattoo/bitchat-tui/main/install.sh | sh`\r\n\r\nThe client is also available on the AUR, Homebrew, and Crates.io. For more information and to contribute, please visit the project repository.","reactions":{"total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
